  "description": "The foundation post-quantum cryptography library for .NET 10. Clean, high-level, secure-by-default wrappers over the BCL's native FIPS 203 (ML-KEM) and FIPS 204 (ML-DSA) implementations across all parameter sets, plus a spec-compliant X-Wing hybrid KEM (ML-KEM-768 + X25519, draft-connolly-cfrg-xwing-kem) for the recommended PQ/T migration path. Two complementary APIs: a typed disposable-key surface for long-lived keys, and a byte-oriented one-shot surface for fire-and-forget use. Span-based zero-allocation overloads, PEM/PKCS#8/SPKI interchange (including password-protected encrypted PKCS#8) with up-front label validation, AOT/trim ready, deterministic builds, SourceLink, and the public API is locked by Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers. Ten runnable samples (including RSA/ECDSA migration, key rotation, large-file streaming, and ASP.NET Core integration), a recipes cookbook, and benchmarks ship with the repo.",
